    "SCHEMA_NAME": "FAM_AMC_COVERAGE_EXPIRY",
    "SCHEMA_DESCR": "AMC Coverage & Expiry — FAM_AMC_CONTRACTS joined through FAM_AMC_CONTRACT_LINE to FAM_ASSET_REGISTER (and its Category/Branch masters), restricted to contract coverage whose END_DATE is on-or-before the selected 'Expiring On or Before' date (default today: shows already-expired plus soon-to-expire coverage). Optional Branch filter defaults to '%' (all branches). Ordered by END_DATE ascending so soonest/most-overdue coverage shows first. EXPIRY_INDICATOR and DAYS_TO_EXPIRY are derived relative to CURRENT_DATE, not the selected filter date.",
